cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Korea Fama-French Factors (FF5 + Momentum)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Woo"
    given-names: "Jihwan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0424-0242"
type: dataset
repository-code: "https://github.com/jihwanw/korea-fama-french-factors-"
url: "https://github.com/jihwanw/korea-fama-french-factors-"
abstract: "Monthly Fama-French five factors plus momentum (MKT-RF, SMB, HML, RMW, CMA, WML) for the Korean stock market (KOSPI and KOSDAQ), July 2001 to present. Constructed from WRDS Compustat Global security and fundamentals data with Bank of Korea ECOS risk-free rates, following Fama and French (1993, 2015) with documented Korean-market adaptations. Implementation verified by replicating official US Fama-French factors (correlations 0.96-0.999)."
keywords:
  - Fama-French factors
  - Korea stock market
  - asset pricing
  - KOSPI
  - KOSDAQ
  - factor investing
